description:
Opal Carers Ltd is a well-established care agency operating in the London and surrounding areas. We are seeking a highly motivated, committed, compassionate and reliable Support Care Worker to work in the Camberley, Surrey area. We are committed to providing a safe and enabling environment for individuals in our care, ensuring that they are treated with the utmost respect and all their individual needs are met. We are looking for candidates with drive and passion.

Candidates must have a full UKs drivers licence mileage will be paid) and candidates must have the right to work in the UK as we currently do not offer sponsorship.

Benefits/Rewards:

£14 ph
- Flexible working hours;
- Full training provided and ongoing 12-week mentor program;
- 28 days paid holiday pro rata increasing to 31 days after continuous service;
- Career investment and development;
- Carer of the month reward;
- Fully funded Level 2/3 qualification in Health & Social Care;
- PPE provided;
- Option to join a pension scheme.

Opal Carers covers: Camberley; Carshalton; Caterham; Cheam; Chessington; Epsom; Epsom Downs; Ewell; Ewell East; Kingston; London areas, New Malden; Sutton; Surbiton; Tadworth, Tolworth; Wallington, West Northamptonshire, Worcester Park.
